      "name": "developer_tests/test_anti_filling.md",
      "filePath": "developer_tests/test_anti_filling.md",
      "summary": "反补满退化测试探针，检测角色是否对短输入/情绪输入/分享输入过度回应（补满模式），含4个测试用例和通过标准（单步位移、不逐项回应、无万能追问句）。",
      "tags": [
        "test-probe",
        "degradation",
        "anti-filling",
        "over-response"
      ],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "language": "markdown"
    },
